WEBVTT

00:13.300 --> 00:16.000
Oh, this is so relaxing.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.340
He's like a tiny Dariel.

00:19.050 --> 00:21.540
You think so? Doesn't he 
look more like Malika?

00:22.340 --> 00:26.390
But I never imagined that 
you'd like children this much,

00:26.390 --> 00:28.110
Where's the Hero's party?

00:28.110 --> 00:31.300
Oh, they're in a neighboring 
town buying pajamas.

00:31.300 --> 00:32.790
We should be all right for a while.

00:34.620 --> 00:36.180
Oh! Your medal!

00:36.840 --> 00:39.740
You're a special envoy, right?
How important a position is that?

00:39.740 --> 00:41.500
The same as the Four Generals.

00:41.500 --> 00:42.680
Wow.

00:42.980 --> 00:44.720
I suppose I have you to thank,

00:44.720 --> 00:46.370
since the mythril issue got me this job.

00:46.370 --> 00:46.940
I see.

00:47.640 --> 00:51.090
But the position of special envoy... 
It didn't exist before, did it?

00:51.090 --> 00:53.150
It wasn't needed before.

00:53.150 --> 00:54.410
After all, we had you.

00:56.740 --> 01:00.410
Goodness! When you say that...

01:03.340 --> 01:08.830
...you make it sound as though we
Four Generals don't do our work properly.

01:09.170 --> 01:10.090
L...

01:10.500 --> 01:12.490
Lady Zebiantes?!

01:12.490 --> 01:15.200
"Speak of the General and 
she'll appear," as they say.

01:15.700 --> 01:18.090
You should watch what you say,

01:18.400 --> 01:20.530
Three-Eyes.

01:21.690 --> 01:25.020
<i>This village gets way too 
many special visitors!</i>

01:39.740 --> 01:43.990
<b>Chillin'</b>

01:39.740 --> 01:43.990
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

02:55.070 --> 02:58.070
<b>Episode 8</b>

02:55.070 --> 02:58.070
<b>Dariel Tends to Many Matters.</b>

03:02.990 --> 03:04.830
How lovely!

03:04.830 --> 03:09.570
There isn't anything quite so amusing 
as a person's terrified face.

03:09.570 --> 03:12.540
D-Dariel, please don't look at me.

03:12.540 --> 03:14.940
Chairs don't talk.

03:16.000 --> 03:18.510
You should've expected to be punished.

03:18.880 --> 03:21.620
After all, while Doroye is 
searching for him so desperately,

03:21.620 --> 03:24.460
you knew where Dariel was and said nothing.

03:25.870 --> 03:27.510
I'm home!

03:27.820 --> 03:31.270
Husba—oh! You have guests, I see.

03:31.720 --> 03:34.100
I'll bring out something to drink.

03:34.100 --> 03:35.930
My, how considerate she is.

03:37.810 --> 03:41.200
Now, it's been quite some
 time, hasn't it, Dariel?

03:41.520 --> 03:43.840
I'd completely forgotten your face.

03:44.670 --> 03:48.990
After all, you weren't just incompetent,
 but average-looking, too.

03:49.480 --> 03:52.750
M-Malika! She's an important guest!

03:52.750 --> 03:55.100
We must be courteous in our hospitali—

03:59.460 --> 04:02.800
There is a chair right over there.

04:04.680 --> 04:06.300
S-So...

04:06.730 --> 04:09.360
Lady Zebiantes, what brings you here?

04:09.360 --> 04:11.810
It isn't that you were looking for me, is it?

04:12.720 --> 04:15.080
O-Of course not!

04:15.080 --> 04:17.290
You simply happened to be here.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.320
My objective is the mythril.

04:21.320 --> 04:24.870
And when one thinks of mythril, 
one thinks of Three-Eyes here.

04:24.870 --> 04:27.580
But he just won't tell anyone anything.

04:28.400 --> 04:32.540
So, since the whole thing's becoming a headache,
I tried a little earnest searching of my own.

04:33.310 --> 04:34.960
I'm sorry, Dariel.

04:34.960 --> 04:36.540
It's not your fault.

04:37.120 --> 04:42.000
High-level users of wind magic can change 
the density of the air to hide themselves.

04:42.000 --> 04:44.830
Lady Zebiantes is a Great Mage of Wind.

04:44.830 --> 04:47.180
You couldn't have noticed her tailing you 
unless she wanted you to.

04:47.180 --> 04:48.900
You're quite knowledgeable, aren't you?

04:48.900 --> 04:51.530
A piece of magic equipment 
made from mythril...

04:51.530 --> 04:53.560
would be worthy of my using it.

04:54.280 --> 04:57.260
I, Zebiantes of the Floral Winds, command you:

04:57.860 --> 05:01.180
Offer to me all the mythril you possess.

05:03.400 --> 05:04.850
I cannot do that.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.070
What?!

05:06.660 --> 05:10.830
It's true that in my current position,
 I oversee the mythril.

05:11.420 --> 05:14.370
However, Rizet has shown good 
faith and determination.

05:14.370 --> 05:16.560
That is how our dealings 
were able to be formalized.

05:16.560 --> 05:18.170
I can't simply give it to you.

05:18.930 --> 05:19.850
However...

05:21.410 --> 05:25.860
Such impudence. You need 
to be taught some manners.

05:34.360 --> 05:36.590
U-Um, Lady Zebiantes?

05:36.590 --> 05:39.560
Shall we go outside for some fresh air?

05:53.010 --> 05:54.660
If words won't work...

05:54.950 --> 05:57.520
then all that's left is to take it by force.

05:58.130 --> 06:02.380
How could you set that 
monstrous village girl on me?

06:03.360 --> 06:05.440
W-Wait, please! Let's talk!

06:06.380 --> 06:08.880
We can talk after I've defeated you!

06:09.690 --> 06:12.000
Rizet! You stay out of this.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.710
If you get into a fight with one of the 
Four Generals, you'll lose your place!

06:14.710 --> 06:15.390
I'm sorry.

06:16.890 --> 06:18.100
Oh my.

06:18.100 --> 06:22.860
A demon relying on a weapon? 
Aren't you embarrassed?

06:26.360 --> 06:27.110
<i>Slash!</i>

06:27.110 --> 06:28.200
Storm Barrier!

06:27.110 --> 06:28.950
<i>But it's really a...</i>

06:28.950 --> 06:30.150
<i>Sting!</i>

06:33.600 --> 06:34.410
This battle is...

06:35.370 --> 06:36.160
Th-Th...

06:36.160 --> 06:37.550
This one doesn't count!

06:37.550 --> 06:38.000
What?

06:38.500 --> 06:41.000
I went a little too easy on you, that's all.

06:41.000 --> 06:42.140
Let's go again!

06:42.140 --> 06:43.720
<i>Can she do that?</i>

06:45.240 --> 06:46.590
Let's go again!

06:47.430 --> 06:49.090
Let's go again!

06:50.930 --> 06:53.100
Let's... go again.

06:53.100 --> 06:55.410
<i>She won't admit that she's lost.</i>

06:57.310 --> 07:01.850
You've simply hidden the mythril 
somewhere in the village, haven't you?

07:02.160 --> 07:04.650
Once I've blown it all away...

07:04.930 --> 07:07.730
I'll take all the time I need finding it.

07:11.470 --> 07:12.320
This is bad!

07:12.320 --> 07:14.120
She's planning to use a Geostorm!

07:14.500 --> 07:15.830
Blow everything away!

07:18.460 --> 07:19.290
Dariel?

07:20.040 --> 07:21.500
Fearsome Emperor's...

07:22.250 --> 07:23.510
Sky Rend!

07:31.560 --> 07:32.760
The Geostorm...

07:33.250 --> 07:35.020
It's being swallowed up?

07:40.100 --> 07:41.390
Lady Zebiantes!

07:42.270 --> 07:43.020
I'll go!

07:44.400 --> 07:45.650
Lady Zebiantes!

08:05.680 --> 08:06.990
Are you all right?

08:06.990 --> 08:08.660
Huh? Um...

08:11.120 --> 08:14.730
You took my panties off!

08:16.430 --> 08:22.580
I'm gonna tell that monstrous village girl!

08:26.660 --> 08:27.940
I'm very sorry.

08:28.790 --> 08:31.170
In apology, I'll give you some mythril.

08:31.170 --> 08:32.690
This is the approximate price.

08:32.690 --> 08:34.220
Hey, Dariel!

08:34.220 --> 08:35.780
I don't really have a choice here!

08:34.770 --> 08:35.780
This is expensive.

08:38.520 --> 08:39.280
All right then.

08:39.870 --> 08:41.470
I'll buy it.

08:41.470 --> 08:43.040
Thank you very much.

08:43.580 --> 08:45.710
Then for the sake of our transaction,

08:45.710 --> 08:49.170
if you could keep me, Rizet, 
and this village confidential?

08:52.600 --> 08:54.420
I suppose I have no choice.

09:00.890 --> 09:04.390
Th-The weapon you carry. 
That's mythril, isn't it?

09:04.390 --> 09:05.190
Yes.

09:05.730 --> 09:07.120
You mean this, right?

09:07.120 --> 09:08.020
Yes, that's right!

09:08.020 --> 09:09.570
Give me one just like it!

09:10.270 --> 09:12.790
One exactly the same 
won't be possible, but...

09:15.680 --> 09:16.570
Welcome,

09:16.570 --> 09:19.760
my dear Owner!

09:19.760 --> 09:22.580
Sakai, this is Lady Zebiantes.

09:23.110 --> 09:28.010
She wants something like the Hermes Sword, 
which combines the power of both magic and the forge.

09:28.010 --> 09:30.170
I'll do it! A quest into the unknown!

09:30.410 --> 09:32.290
I do like your spirit.

09:33.790 --> 09:36.580
I didn't realize the time. 
I'll be heading back now.

09:36.580 --> 09:37.180
The time?

09:37.760 --> 09:40.680
Oh, no! The Hero's party will be back soon!

09:40.680 --> 09:43.870
It would be really bad if they ran into 
one of the Four Generals, wouldn't it?

09:43.870 --> 09:45.290
Let's see...

09:45.290 --> 09:47.270
First, I'll need to stall them!

09:47.900 --> 09:48.900
Sakai!

09:49.300 --> 09:52.630
Please take as long as possible 
to listen to her order.

09:52.630 --> 09:53.970
As you wish.

09:55.170 --> 09:56.050
Oh!

09:56.050 --> 09:58.060
Rizet, thank you for everything.

09:58.060 --> 09:59.680
Come and see us again sometime.

09:59.680 --> 10:00.510
Bye!

10:03.870 --> 10:05.750
He's always in such high spirits.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.650
Miss Laidy!

10:14.140 --> 10:16.580
W-Welcome back.

10:16.580 --> 10:18.760
How did you do finding pajamas?

10:18.760 --> 10:19.210
What?

10:19.210 --> 10:23.940
Y-You're that interested in my pajamas?

10:21.680 --> 10:24.710
I bought fluffy pink ones! Want to see?

10:23.940 --> 10:25.520
That's wonderful!

10:25.520 --> 10:27.870
And I'm sorry to ask when 
you must be tired, but...

10:27.870 --> 10:30.350
Mister Sessha! I'd like to ask 
you to complete a quest today!

10:30.920 --> 10:34.000
Miss Satome, would you 
be able to help Malika?

10:34.000 --> 10:34.860
S-Sure.

10:35.410 --> 10:36.780
And Miss Laidy...

10:39.160 --> 10:41.770
...practice your sword swing a 
hundred thousand times, please!

10:41.770 --> 10:42.780
Y-Yes, sir!

10:44.020 --> 10:45.260
<i>I do feel bad,</i>

10:45.260 --> 10:47.700
<i>but this ought to keep her
stuck here for a while.</i>

10:49.610 --> 10:53.040
The one-stop shopping is convenient, 
but I do believe I've bought too much.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.860
Perhaps.

10:54.860 --> 10:58.530
But I believe that money should 
be spent on one's dreams.

10:58.530 --> 11:00.550
That way, it all comes 
back to you in the end.

11:00.890 --> 11:03.360
Toss that in for me too, then.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.990
Thank you so much!

11:04.990 --> 11:07.530
<i>Sakai, you are terrifying.</i>

11:04.990 --> 11:07.530
Thank you!

11:08.110 --> 11:09.890
<i>Things look all right here.</i>

11:09.890 --> 11:12.780
Nine hundred ninety-nine thousand,
nine hundred and ninety-nine!

11:12.780 --> 11:14.380
One hundred thousand!

11:16.860 --> 11:18.330
I'm done.

11:18.330 --> 11:20.700
Well done, honored Hero!

11:20.700 --> 11:23.170
Th-Thank you. Um...

11:23.170 --> 11:24.910
Would it be all right if I went
 to get cleaned up now?

11:24.910 --> 11:26.360
Oh. Yes!

11:34.800 --> 11:35.590
Huh?

11:35.590 --> 11:37.300
Sakai? What's going on?

11:37.300 --> 11:39.420
I'm sorry, Owner.

11:39.840 --> 11:41.750
I couldn't hold out long enough.

11:46.760 --> 11:50.380
This bath's lack of water is very odd.

11:50.380 --> 11:55.560
Yes, I was taken aback at first, too, 
but now I'm completely in love with it.

11:55.860 --> 11:59.850
And bathing in water after
 is just so addicting.

11:59.850 --> 12:01.820
What? Bathing after?

12:02.080 --> 12:02.820
Oh.

12:04.460 --> 12:05.740
You're...

12:05.740 --> 12:07.830
the General of Wind!

12:07.830 --> 12:08.730
Who are you, again?

12:08.730 --> 12:09.620
<i>This isn't good!</i>

12:09.620 --> 12:11.000
Don't do anything rash!

12:10.450 --> 12:12.160
You... Sneaking into this 
peaceful village to...

12:16.400 --> 12:17.670
<i>Pounded rice cakes on the right...</i>

12:17.910 --> 12:19.670
<i>And pounded rice cakes on the left...</i>

12:19.670 --> 12:20.850
<i>Could this be...</i>

12:21.420 --> 12:23.050
<i>mirror rice cakes?</i>

12:23.050 --> 12:26.050
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

12:45.650 --> 12:47.870
I'm sure you must be bursting 
with things to tell me,

12:48.530 --> 12:51.620
but it's time for dinner right now.

12:51.620 --> 12:53.620
<i>An interrogation at the dining table...</i>

12:53.980 --> 12:56.520
<i>So, this is what a public 
execution feels like.</i>

12:56.520 --> 12:57.630
Dariel!

12:57.920 --> 13:02.600
I realize that you had reasons for 
what you did earlier, however—

13:02.600 --> 13:04.310
Dariel...

13:05.140 --> 13:07.640
Who is this woman?

13:07.640 --> 13:09.360
I am the Hero, Laidy!

13:09.360 --> 13:11.480
We've fought before, you know!

13:11.480 --> 13:13.680
I don't remember that.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.820
Dariel!

13:16.350 --> 13:20.060
Why are you acting so familiar 
with one of the Four Generals?

13:21.890 --> 13:24.860
<i>I suppose I can't keep 
quiet about it any longer.</i>

13:26.020 --> 13:27.610
The truth is...

13:28.250 --> 13:31.480
I am a human who was raised among demons.

13:36.240 --> 13:37.620
Right after he proposed to me...

13:38.840 --> 13:41.130
he told me all about it.

13:43.200 --> 13:46.080
So, that's why you were 
wandering in that forest.

13:46.600 --> 13:49.890
I'm sorry for hiding it 
from you for all this time.

13:50.720 --> 13:52.830
I'm sorry it took so long for me to tell you.

13:53.530 --> 13:55.040
It doesn't bother me.

13:56.050 --> 13:59.150
Whether your past is with humankind or demonkind

14:00.400 --> 14:03.290
has no bearing on the love I have for you...

14:03.730 --> 14:06.130
Yes. Thank you.

14:08.330 --> 14:11.320
Dariel, you were a human all along?

14:11.810 --> 14:13.280
I see.

14:14.170 --> 14:16.010
I understand your situation.

14:16.570 --> 14:17.750
However...

14:18.150 --> 14:20.290
Zebiantes of the Four Generals.

14:20.290 --> 14:22.640
There's no reason for her 
to be here, is there?

14:22.640 --> 14:25.740
Monst—er, Missus? Another serving of stew, pl—

14:26.610 --> 14:29.230
Demons should return to demon territory.

14:29.230 --> 14:30.510
You do value your life, don't you?

14:31.620 --> 14:35.520
Dariel, can't you do 
something about this woman?

14:35.850 --> 14:38.850
B-Both of you, please calm down.

14:41.680 --> 14:46.840
If you clash with everything you've got, 
that will help you understand one another.

14:46.840 --> 14:47.610
Won't it?

14:48.480 --> 14:50.400
If the missus is all right with that, then...

14:50.400 --> 14:51.500
Very well.

14:51.500 --> 14:53.690
This way, I will be able to 
fulfill my duty as Hero.

14:53.690 --> 14:54.700
Wait, please!

14:55.540 --> 14:59.360
I will stand witness to your duel.

14:59.360 --> 14:59.870
And...

15:00.500 --> 15:03.790
Please promise that no matter who wins,
 you will not kill the other.

15:03.790 --> 15:06.880
What? Whose side are you on?

15:06.880 --> 15:08.380
I am no one's enemy or ally here.

15:09.080 --> 15:12.380
I simply don't want anyone to die.

15:13.860 --> 15:16.060
I understand, and I so promise.

15:16.060 --> 15:17.690
I don't want to.

15:18.560 --> 15:21.430
If we're going to do this,
 I want to go as hard as I can.

15:21.430 --> 15:24.170
Then we can forget about 
the issue of the mythril.

15:24.170 --> 15:25.950
And we can forget about having seconds.

15:25.950 --> 15:27.610
O-Oh, all right!

15:27.610 --> 15:29.570
I promise. I promise!

15:29.920 --> 15:35.030
Then tomorrow morning, the duel will be 
held on a plain in the western forest.

15:36.360 --> 15:40.520
In that case, I'll have to
 eat plenty for dinner.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.040
You're certainly carefree.

15:42.990 --> 15:45.290
Carefree? Not at all.

15:45.600 --> 15:49.060
I'm maintaining proper conditioning 
for tomorrow. Don't you see?

15:49.060 --> 15:51.710
The fight has already begun.

15:51.710 --> 15:54.550
Malika, please make mine an extra-large serving.

15:55.200 --> 15:57.080
Thank you! It was delicious!

15:58.060 --> 16:01.060
Now, then, straight to sleep for me.

16:01.690 --> 16:03.810
An amateur move, General of Wind.

16:04.740 --> 16:09.320
Dariel, is there anywhere in this 
village where one can soak in hot water?

16:09.630 --> 16:13.490
If that's what you're looking for, there's the
 iron bath Sakai uses at the forg—

16:14.320 --> 16:18.240
If one doesn't soak in a warm 
bath two hours before sleeping,

16:18.240 --> 16:19.780
then one cannot have a good night's sleep!

16:19.780 --> 16:23.260
By having a bath first, 
you will secure sufficient sleep,

16:23.260 --> 16:25.640
and thus have the upper hand.
Is that what you mean?

16:25.640 --> 16:28.220
I'm the one who will win!

16:32.100 --> 16:36.000
Apologies for asking so suddenly, 
but may I use your bath?

16:36.000 --> 16:37.350
Let me borrow your bath, won't you?

16:38.640 --> 16:40.260
I wonder if Lady Zebiantes

16:40.260 --> 16:42.300
is planning to stay here with us.

17:05.600 --> 17:06.970
Owner...

17:07.940 --> 17:08.960
Sakai?!

17:09.300 --> 17:12.660
The most important point to note in 
obtaining the advantage in this duel...

17:12.660 --> 17:15.970
wasn't food, or sleep, or even a bath.

17:17.320 --> 17:20.780
It was obtaining one of 
Sakai's mythril weapons.

17:21.560 --> 17:25.820
So the little smithy here went ahead and 
finished the she-whelp's weapon, too.

17:25.820 --> 17:28.230
He's just so talented, isn't he?

17:28.690 --> 17:30.910
Owner...

17:30.910 --> 17:32.570
You're all right now.

17:32.570 --> 17:36.490
Sakai was practically too tired to speak,
and you made him work <i>through</i> the night?

17:36.830 --> 17:39.450
I do feel badly for him,

17:39.450 --> 17:41.530
but this is our chance to
destroy one of the Four Generals!

17:41.870 --> 17:44.990
What a spirited little she-whelp you are.

17:44.990 --> 17:47.670
I'll teach you how to sob and wail.

17:47.670 --> 17:49.170
Owner...

17:56.080 --> 17:57.340
Sky Rend!

18:11.220 --> 18:12.480
Husband!

18:13.090 --> 18:16.030
I know it's a little early, but I've
 brought some lunches I packed.

18:16.030 --> 18:17.100
Thank you!

18:18.230 --> 18:19.840
Which one's winning?

18:19.840 --> 18:21.240
They're completely evenly matched.

18:48.720 --> 18:52.680
Verdure beyond the heavens, 
send the wisdom of the gods here...

18:58.170 --> 19:00.160
Gather, flashing,

19:00.880 --> 19:02.210
and crush!

19:04.910 --> 19:07.160
Symphonic Laser!

19:07.610 --> 19:09.410
Sky Rend!

19:15.060 --> 19:16.000
Mayor?

19:16.390 --> 19:18.130
You can put up barriers?

19:18.130 --> 19:19.650
I just copied you.

19:21.070 --> 19:23.160
Oh, Gran. Did that wake you?

19:40.720 --> 19:41.570
Gran!

19:41.880 --> 19:43.450
Come back here, Gran!

19:46.010 --> 19:46.700
What?

19:56.820 --> 19:58.570
Storm Barrier!

20:07.830 --> 20:10.060
Gran! Husband!

20:10.550 --> 20:11.540
Gran!

20:11.540 --> 20:12.590
Little one!

20:20.250 --> 20:20.820
Huh?

20:22.670 --> 20:24.290
I'm so glad he's safe.

20:28.360 --> 20:30.330
Was that... fun?

20:30.780 --> 20:31.940
It was...

20:32.540 --> 20:33.870
...fun?

20:34.560 --> 20:38.380
It seems he thought the two 
of you were playing with him.

20:50.970 --> 20:52.650
Shall we call an end to this, then?

20:52.650 --> 20:53.810
Yes, let's.

20:54.590 --> 20:57.060
That really was fun.

20:57.700 --> 21:00.940
Yes. Earlier, I had the feeling we 
didn't really want to kill each other,

21:00.940 --> 21:03.010
and that you'd successfully
block that attack, Zebi.

21:03.010 --> 21:04.160
That means...

21:04.160 --> 21:08.060
that you and I have perfect 
chemistry, my dear Laidy.

21:09.260 --> 21:10.900
Hello, friend!

21:12.240 --> 21:16.060
Say, let's go use that bath 
together again sometime!

21:14.210 --> 21:18.540
This is the scene you wanted to 
see more than anything, isn't it?

21:16.720 --> 21:17.810
What?

21:18.540 --> 21:20.110
Well, I suppose I'll have to, then.

21:20.110 --> 21:21.470
<i>That's right.</i>

21:21.470 --> 21:23.590
<i>Rizet and I aren't enough.</i>

21:24.540 --> 21:26.650
<i>Thanks to these two, I can believe.</i>

21:27.380 --> 21:29.800
<i>Regardless of whether a 
person is human or demon...</i>

21:30.340 --> 21:32.610
<i>a future where we can all 
smile together does exist!</i>

21:35.360 --> 21:37.560
Well, after all that playing,

21:38.030 --> 21:39.680
shall we have lunch now?

21:39.680 --> 21:41.270
Yes!

23:15.960 --> 23:17.990
Dariel!

23:19.980 --> 23:21.360
What's wrong?

23:21.360 --> 23:25.210
While on my quest, I encountered 
the most amazing individual!

23:25.530 --> 23:27.340
An amazing individual?

23:30.560 --> 23:33.930
This is the previous Hero, Alantsil!

23:41.660 --> 23:46.110
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s after 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.400 --> 23:48.470
"Dariel Has a Reunion."

23:47.280 --> 23:51.070
<b>Episode 9</b>

23:47.280 --> 23:51.070
<b>Dariel Has a Reunion.</b>
